Here is my thought:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;match those four numbers &lt;code&gt;3 7 8 9&lt;/code&gt; var &lt;code&gt;^[3|7|8|9]\(&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;match number &lt;code&gt;87&lt;/code&gt; var &lt;code&gt;^87\)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Then combine them together, &lt;code&gt;(^[3|7|8|9]\(|^87\))&lt;/code&gt;. With some test, it seems correct. Is there any way to do that more efficiently?&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>